{"type":"message","id":"81305ff4","parentId":"c1c6f3f9","timestamp":"2026-06-24T08:42:30.678Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You are the tester agent.\n\nTASK ID: task-005\n\nTASK: Behavior tests for multi-model routing\n\nDESCRIPTION:\nWrite comprehensive behavior tests for the multi-model routing feature (issue #86). Tests must be derived from the specification, NOT from implementation code.\n\n## Context\nRead `/home/vedat/work/personal/semblr/temp/issue-86-analysis.md` for the full specification.\nRead task-003's output at `/home/vedat/work/personal/semblr/temp/task-003-output.md` for type definitions and helper signatures.\nYou are working on branch `feature/86-multi-model-routing`.\n\n## Test Categories\n\n### 1. `resolveModelId` (lib/resolve-model-id.ts)\n- `\"glm-5.2:cloud\"` → `{ provider: \"ollama\", model: \"glm-5.2\" }`\n- `\"kimi-k2.6:cloud\"` → `{ provider: \"ollama\", model: \"kimi-k2.6\" }`\n- `\"openai/gpt-4\"` → `{ provider: \"openai\", model: \"gpt-4\" }` (no :cloud, pass through)\n- Edge: empty string, `\":cloud\"`, multiple `:cloud:cloud`\n\n### 2. `getModelForPhase` / phase map (lib/phase-model-map.ts)\n- Each phase maps to correct model (or null for thinking)\n- Unknown phase → returns null or throws\n- Map is immutable\n\n### 3. Tool schema validation\n- Valid phases (\"thinking\", \"executing\", \"stuck\", \"reporting\", \"reviewing\", \"verifying\") pass\n- Invalid phases (\"planning\", \"\", null) fail validation\n- Missing phase field fails validation\n\n### 4. Switch counter behavior\n- Tool call increments counter up to maxSwitches\n- After maxSwitches reached, further phase reports don't trigger switches\n- Counter resets at cycle boundaries (testable via state inspection)\n\n### 5. Model switching logic\n- Phase → null → stays on current model (no switch)\n- Phase → same model → no switch counted\n- Phase → different model → pending switch queued\n- Switch only applied at agent_end, not mid-generation\n\n### 6. Config gating\n- When disabled: tool calls are no-ops, no switches occur\n- When enabled: full routing active\n- Config defaults: enabled=false, maxSwitches=3\n\n### 7. Integration scenario\n- Full cycle: thinking→executing→stuck→reporting→verifying\n- Verify correct model transitions at each agent_end boundary\n\n## Requirements\n- Use vitest (matches project)\n- Follow existing test patterns in the project\n- Tests MUST pass against the implementation from task-003 and task-004\n- Write tests to files in `tests/` directory\n- Do NOT rely on stdout — write results to `/home/vedat/work/personal/semblr/temp/task-005-output.md`\n\n## Verification\n```bash\nnpx vitest run\n```\n\nComplete this task using available tools. Report STATUS when finished."}],"timestamp":1782290550659}}
